#: enclave-vault/src/engine.rs
msgid "This device"
msgstr "[Thís dévíçé····]"

#: ui/app.slint
msgid "This device has no keyring for Enclave's keys, so they are kept in files. An Enclave PIN protects them if someone copies those files; longer is safer. You'll type it each time Enclave starts; if you forget it, your recovery words bring your account back."
