#: ui/app.slint
msgid "This device has no keyring for Enclave's keys, so they are kept in files. Choose an Enclave PIN: it protects them if someone copies those files. Longer is safer."
msgstr "[Thís dévíçé hás ñó kéýríñg fór Éñçlávé's kéýs, só théý áré képt íñ fílés. Çhóósé áñ Éñçlávé PÍÑ: ít prótéçts thém íf sóméóñé çópíés thósé fílés. Lóñgér ís sáfér.································································]"

#: enclave-vault/src/engine.rs
msgid "This device keeps Enclave's keys in files, so the Enclave PIN can't be removed."
msgstr "[Thís dévíçé kééps Éñçlávé's kéýs íñ fílés, só thé Éñçlávé PÍÑ çáñ't bé rémóvéd.·······························]"

#: ui/app.slint
