#: enclave-vault/src/engine.rs
msgid "This device was removed from your account on another device. It can't get new messages."
msgstr "[Thís dévíçé wás rémóvéd fróm ýóúr áççóúñt óñ áñóthér dévíçé. Ít çáñ't gét ñéw mésságés.··································]"

